{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_title", "source_sha256": "3470e0f55dcabd2053a5b17fc9f54e4966ac45b8976d70ae933a68ceec88f36a", "ja": "環とおでかけ2", "zh": "和环出门2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ccc91ae8e944c536190eb8027c74cee0bb7e825d76fdd97a088b231ef03e1d8e", "ja": "環とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "和环一起外出的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "061dffd1c4663f0c2a22411f630757c8d65c6dcc8969f86f1d57950436f3d2d7", "ja": "（仕事の合間、環と一緒に浄土ヶ浜へ立ち寄った。\n風光明媚な、良いところだな……）", "zh": "（工作间隙和环一起顺道去了净土浜。\n真是个风景秀丽的好地方啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "8aaf79db3d110de6edecd6b9cc2436bb63aecc9f4c031a1394abf9a571ce1233", "ja": "おやぶん、すっごいぞー！　おっきな岩とか島が\nどかーんってある！　秘密基地とかあるかも……。", "zh": "老大，好厉害啊——！有巨大的岩石和岛屿轰隆隆地坐落在那里！说不定还有秘密基地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f14950042678974492ae8925becf0d9ae2a89f95315f2e52aa2d6d595f1fe355", "ja": "なるほど……。確かに、\n自然に出来た地形なのにカッコイイもんな。", "zh": "原来如此……确实，明明是自然形成的地形，却很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "bdbda2fc50bc39a2b0f72e141826e96e34ef44b600ab1eec2b4a109ed376e915", "ja": "船で行ったどうくつも、すっごく青くてきれいだった！\n探検したら、宝箱とかあったりするかも……あっ！", "zh": "坐船去的那个洞窟，蓝得可漂亮了！\n要是去探险的话，说不定会有宝箱什么的……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "33c4f32d50602b35682d1fa84d7bffeb450f063d637f64e666c415fa3da9ebf9", "ja": "貝がら見つけたぞー！\n大きいから、これはおやぶんにあげるね！", "zh": "找到贝壳了！\n这么大，这个就送给老大吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "59328f7539f8983f50866f563139661785627e439329c88db74f55ab0f3afc8f", "ja": "おお……立派な貝殻だな！\nこれはホタテかな？　すごいものを拾ったな、環。", "zh": "哦……真是漂亮的贝壳啊！\n这是扇贝吗？你捡到宝贝了啊，环。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "e9b4905f67d13c88ca3fa8d107f089304a73c1d6a6c189168666080271c3fa82", "ja": "たまき、カッコイイ貝がらみつけるのとくいなんだ。\nおやぶん、もっと欲しい？", "zh": "环，最擅长找漂亮的贝壳了。\n老大，还想要更多吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2e8772e1a5fb7b3ccbcb1870276a45e1c018ca081533b0c4b04e1b212ad3ac8d", "ja": "よし、じゃあ探索を頼む。\nもっとカッコイイのがないか、探してみよう！", "zh": "好，那就拜托你探索了。\n看看还有没有更帅气的，找找看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_040tam02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_040tam02_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "69729e25bbd1b8b9e8c82b892d41157e944a1395f93985c31e3e393b7c84cc7f", "ja": "りょうかいっ！　どっちがすごいのを見つけるか、\nきょうそうだぞ～。くふふ♪", "zh": "明白！看谁能找到更厉害的东西，来比赛吧～咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
